  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 28 October 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nIn the Highly Sought-After Rangitoto College Zone\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated and perfectly positioned in sought-after Rothesay Bay, this elevated north-facing cedar weatherboard home combines modern comfort, established charm and beautiful sea views. Set on a 471m² (more or less) freehold section, it offers four bedrooms, two bathrooms and exceptional spaces for family living and entertaining, just moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nFully double glazed throughout, the home offers warmth, comfort and a quieter living environment. Three separate air-conditioning units provide flexible temperature control, while a near-new quality Colorsteel roof and freshly painted interiors and exterior complete the refreshed presentation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three bedrooms are complemented by a stylish new kitchen, a beautifully renovated bathroom, and separate living and dining areas. Mains gas cooking and hot water bring everyday convenience, while excellent indoor-outdoor flow makes entertaining effortless.\r\n\r\nOne of the home’s most charming features is the beautiful built-in window seat, perfectly positioned to take advantage of the elevated sea outlook. Imagine sitting here with your morning coffee, looking out towards the sea, enjoying the natural light and peaceful surroundings — a simple everyday pleasure that captures the relaxed coastal lifestyle this home offers.\r\n\r\nThe generous north-facing deck is another standout — ideal for summer barbecues, family meals or relaxing with friends while enjoying the elevated outlook. Private access to Knights Reserve adds another dimension to the lifestyle, connecting your backyard directly to inviting green space.\r\n\r\nDownstairs features a fourth bedroom, lounge, bathroom and an additional pantry room with a water connection. This versatile space is ideal for extended family, teenagers or guests, with potential to explore self-contained accommodation, subject to the necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage provides secure parking and storage, complemented by an additional covered parking space beneath the deck. High-quality furnishings add to the home’s welcoming appeal.\r\n\r\nEducation is a major drawcard, with zoning for Rangitoto College, Northcross Intermediate, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Browns Bay School and Murrays Bay School. The primary schools are within walking distance, making this an appealing location for growing families.\r\n\r\nWith beautifully updated interiors, elevated sea views, superb outdoor living and a prized coastal setting, this is a home ready to enjoy.\r\n\r\nImagine relaxing on the window seat, looking out towards the sea and enjoying the peace and privacy of your own coastal retreat.\r\n\r\nDiscover the comfort, space and lifestyle waiting for you at 71 Knights Road.",
